      "message": "Hi Gwendal,\n\nI\u0027m not familiar with how the iioservice stuff works.   It looks like there are some READMEs out there I\u0027ll need to work through:\n\n1. https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/HEAD/mojo/README.md\n1. https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/HEAD/docs/mojo_and_services.md\n\nWe were taking this approach, since it lets us easily call into the DTPC ASL code with the corresponding Coreboot changes:\n\n67793: ec/google/chromec: Host event support of DTTS | https://review.coreboot.org/c/coreboot/+/67793\n\nCan you give a little more detail on what using iioservice/mojo would look like when trying to call back into the ASL code?",
