      "writtenOn": "2022-10-25T15:07:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looking at the code sample you posted, I think it\u0027s fine. It\u0027s just passing a notification indicating that the switch needs to be reevaluated. \n\nhttps://uefi.org/htmlspecs/ACPI_Spec_6_4_html/11_Thermal_Management/thermal-control.html?highlight\u003d0x81#dynamically-changing-cooling-temperature-trip-points\n\nSo it should be fine to trigger this event as necessary.",
      "parentUuid": "19d92eb9_c1e9573f",
