      "writtenOn": "2022-10-25T15:43:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e It\u0027s just passing a notification indicating that the switch needs to be reevaluated.\n\nYeah, thinking about this some more last night, I think that case should be fine.\n\nI do wonder if there will be devices like this winterhold device that:\n1. Supports body detection\n2. Does not support tablet mode\n\nThen, while handling the tablet mode notification the ASL accesses something that\u0027s not actually present/enabled and hits an error. Presumably that would be a bug and various protections should already be in place (`#ifdef`s, etc.), but the device was never intended to go down that path anyway so it\u0027s been untested and hidden for now.\n\nOr maybe that\u0027s too paranoid of a thought. Also, beyond landing the CL and seeing if things blow up, I\u0027m not sure how to validate the CL otherwise.",
      "parentUuid": "0d1f42bd_207ea75c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 116,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 119,
        "endChar": 6
